    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": "Convert String to Uppercase"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We know that the toupper() function converts a character to uppercase. In this example, we will use these functions to convert an entire string to uppercase."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Thought Process"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "We can't directly use the toupper() function to convert a string since it only converts a single character to uppercase."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "So, we need to access each character of the string and convert it to uppercase. To do this, we will be using a for loop. Each iteration of the loop will change each string character to uppercase."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Source Code"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "cpp",
      "content": "1#include <iostream>\n2#include <cctype>\n3using namespace std;\n4\n5int main() {\n6\n7    string text;\n8\n9    cout << \"Enter a string: \";\n10    getline(cin, text);\n11\n12    // convert to uppercase\n13    for (int i = 0; i < text.length(); ++i) {\n14        text[i] = toupper(text[i]);\n15    }\n16\n17    cout << \"Uppercase = \" << text << endl;\n18\n19    return 0;\n20}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Output"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "text",
      "content": "Enter a string: Iron Maiden!\nUppercase = IRON MAIDEN!"
    },
